{
  "name": "@deepwhale-cn/dsh-sidebar-compact",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "深鲸侧栏收纳：给侧栏插件列表限高 + 内部滚动，插件多了也不挤掉会话区（纯 CSS，不加入口）",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "keywords": ["dsh","dsh-plugin","deepseek-harness","plugin","sidebar","ui","layout","侧栏"],
